  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f59101f9f0c18e74aba7228e60820b17, type: 3}
  m_Name: instruct_vr
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Slide
  timeLimit: 120
  slideType: 2
  question: 
  answerChoices: []
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  infographic: {fileID: 0}
  instruction: 'FULL VR EXPERIENCE (Headset On)


    You are about to complete a
    fully immersive virtual reality learning activity.


    The activity consists
    of a series of infographic slides presented in a random order, followed by a
    short multiple-choice quiz designed to assess your understanding of the material.


    A
    timer is displayed in the top-left corner of each slide. When the timer reaches
    zero, the next slide will automatically appear. If a quiz question is not answered
    before time expires, it will be marked as incorrect.


    In addition to the
    instructional content, you will have access to an interactive 3D model of the
    brain that can be explored throughout the experience. Use the VR controllers
    to interact with both the educational content and the 3D model to support your
    learning.

'
